; 0 zero scan, 1 header decode and context, 2 frame hash, 3 seal decode,
; 4 digest fetch. Chain (found position): seal unit 0 context, 1 seal hash;
; records unit 0 context, 1 frame hash, 2 commitment; page unit 0 context,
; 1 page hash. Codes: :more :again :empty :invalid :candidate :next-role
